 "why_floorplan": "l3 (l2 7e3f21a6a NEEDS_HUMAN PPL-0111 at 3_2_place_iop: W face 1112 pins (wrq 32 + wrr 514 + wwq 560 + cr/done 6) and E face 1138 pins (lsw_d 512 + ldr_d 512 + sec 90 + dm 16 + v/rv 8) on ONE horizontal pin layer (M4, 48 nm pitch, 2-track slots) had 1065 slots on 103.68 um). Outline from pin demand: H 120.96 um gives ~1245 M4 slots (E 91%, W 89%); N/S carry 724/719 pins on M3+M5 (~1.9k slots on 77.76 um, 38%), so the width is set by area: core 73.44 x 116.64 = 8566 um2, util 46%. No M6 grant needed.",
